# Docker reads .dockerignore only from the root of the BUILD CONTEXT, and the
# context is the monorepo root (deploy.yml: `context: .`, `file: apps/web/Dockerfile`).
# This file must therefore stay here, not travel into apps/web.
#
# Every directory pattern is `**/`-prefixed. Docker matches context-relative
# paths segment-by-segment, so a bare `node_modules` excludes only the top-level
# one and would let apps/web/node_modules — carrying a Windows-built Prisma
# engine — into the builder via `COPY . .`, overwriting the musl engine
# installed in the deps stage.

.git
.github
infrastructure
docs

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/build
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.swc
**/*.tsbuildinfo

**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.md
**/.DS_Store

# Institutional source data and reference decks: read only by
# apps/web/scripts/generate-roster.mjs on a developer machine, never at build or
# run time. ~20 MB that would otherwise be uploaded as build context.
Tier1
**/*.pdf
**/*.pptx
**/*.xlsx
**/*.docx
**/*.mp4
**/*.zip

# Untracked local debugging scripts (smoke/probe/ovf/rolecheck/addflow)
**/*.local.mjs
